{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IDataProtectionManager/IDataProtectionManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IDataProtectionManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IDataProtectionManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IDataProtectionManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IDataProtectionManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">数据保护管理类用于保护用户数据。为了完成功能逻辑或者上报埋点数据，DJI MSDK会在后台将用户数据发送到DJI服务器。你可以调用相关接口同意或者不同意DJI MSDK上报用户数据。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">数据保护管理类用于保护用户数据。为了完成功能逻辑或者上报埋点数据，DJI MSDK会在后台将用户数据发送到DJI服务器。你可以调用相关接口同意或者不同意DJI MSDK上报用户数据。 <br><br><b>注意： 此类只管理DJI MSDK后台上报的用户数据，不会管理通过调用接口的方式传入的用户数据。</b> <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.6.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">6</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">6</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"agreetoproductimprovement 同意或不同意产品改进计划。通过该计划，dji msdk将收集dji设备uuid、移动设备uuid以及您的诊断数据和用量数据进行用户行为分析，此分析有助于dji改进产品和服务。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">agreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">同意或不同意产品改进计划。通过该计划，DJI MSDK将收集DJI设备UUID、移动设备UUID以及您的诊断数据和用量数据进行用户行为分析，此分析有助于DJI改进产品和服务。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isagreetoproductimprovement 获取是否同意产品改进计划。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取是否同意产品改进计划。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"enablemsdklog 开启或者关闭msdk日志存储功能，此功能默认开启。可通过getmsdklogpath获取日志的存储路径。当msdk发生问题时，可将此msdk日志发送给dji分析和定位解决问题。当日志过多的时候可以调用 clearmsdklog 清除日志。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">enableMSDKLog</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">开启或者关闭MSDK日志存储功能，此功能默认开启。可通过getMSDKLogPath获取日志的存储路径。当MSDK发生问题时，可将此MSDK日志发送给DJI分析和定位解决问题。当日志过多的时候可以调用 clearMSDKLog 清除日志。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"ismsdklogenabled 获取是否开启msdk日志存储功能。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isMSDKLogEnabled</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取是否开启MSDK日志存储功能。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getmsdklogpath 获取msdk的存储路径。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getMSDKLogPath</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取MSDK的存储路径。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"clearmsdklog 清除msdk日志。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">clearMSDKLog</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">清除MSDK日志。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<h4 id=\"产品改进计划\">产品改进计划</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\">agreeToProductImprovement</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>agreeToProductImprovement</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">agreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">isAgree</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">同意或不同意产品改进计划。通过该计划，DJI MSDK将收集DJI设备UUID、移动设备UUID以及您的诊断数据和用量数据进行用户行为分析，此分析有助于DJI改进产品和服务。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>isAgree</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true 表示同意产品改进计划。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isAgreeToProductImprovement</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isAgreeToProductImprovement</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取是否同意产品改进计划。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true 表示同意产品改进计划。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<p><br></p>\n<h4 id=\"MSDK-日志\">MSDK 日志</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\">enableMSDKLog</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>enableMSDKLog</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.10.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">enableMSDKLog</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">enabled</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">开启或者关闭MSDK日志存储功能，此功能默认开启。可通过<code><a href=\"IDataProtectionManager.html#idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\">getMSDKLogPath</a></code>获取日志的存储路径。当MSDK发生问题时，可将此MSDK日志发送给DJI分析和定位解决问题。当日志过多的时候可以调用 <code><a href=\"IDataProtectionManager.html#idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\">clearMSDKLog</a></code> 清除日志。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>enabled</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true 表示开启MSDK的日志存储功能。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\">isMSDKLogEnabled</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isMSDKLogEnabled</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.10.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isMSDKLogEnabled</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取是否开启MSDK日志存储功能。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true 表示开启MSDK日志存储功能。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\">getMSDKLogPath</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getMSDKLogPath</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.10.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getMSDKLogPath</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取MSDK的存储路径。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>返回MSDK的存储路径。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\">clearMSDKLog</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearMSDKLog</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.10.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearMSDKLog</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">清除MSDK日志。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true 表示成功清除MSDK日志。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">本页目录</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">概览</a></li><li><a href=\"#类成员\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">成员索引</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">方法</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_agreetoproductimprovement\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>agreeToProductImprovement</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_isagreetoproductimprovement\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isAgreeToProductImprovement</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_enablemsdklog\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>enableMSDKLog</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_ismsdklogenabled\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>isMSDKLogEnabled</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_getmsdklogpath\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getMSDKLogPath</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\" data-target=\"idjidataprotectionmanager_clearmsdklog\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>clearMSDKLog</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      ","buildId":"1795058050072"}